^scip-java maven . . io/taskmigo/web/adapter/in/http/support/security/ApiSecurityErrorRenderer#ÃRenders authentication and authorization failures using an API-version-specific response contract.

The shared security error handler delegates to the first configured renderer whose
[#supports(HttpServletRequest)] method matches the request. A matching renderer owns the complete response and
prevents later renderers from running.(2ApiSecurityErrorRenderer:1"java*)public interface ApiSecurityErrorRendererê
iscip-java maven . . io/taskmigo/web/adapter/in/http/support/security/ApiSecurityErrorRenderer#supports().÷Returns whether this renderer owns security failures for the request.

@param request the request whose API version or response contract is being selected
@return `true` when this renderer should handle the failure"x
rscip-java maven . . io/taskmigo/web/adapter/in/http/api/v0/support/security/ApiV0SecurityErrorRenderer#supports().(B2supports:D"java*<public abstract boolean supports(HttpServletRequest request)°
