scip-java maven maven/io.taskmigo/access-control 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT io/taskmigo/authorization/statement/StatementTargetPathMatcher#ÿCompiles and applies Taskmigo's bounded regular-expression contract for Statement API target paths.

The expression syntax is intentionally smaller than RE2. It is limited to printable ASCII expressions with
literals, '.', character classes, capturing groups, alternation, anchors, '*', '+', '?', ASCII shorthand classes,
and escaped punctuation. Engine extensions, Unicode/property escapes, counted repetition, and excessive grouping
are rejected before RE2/J is invoked.(2StatementTargetPathMatcher:5"java*-public final class StatementTargetPathMatcherÈ
