ôscip-java maven . . io/taskmigo/authorization/request/application/service/RequestAuthorizationServiceTest#shouldDenyRequestWhenNoStatementGrantsAccess().µ Verifies the default-deny Request Authorization contract.

 Given: a principal with no effective Statements for the request.
